# Champion of the Weird (CR 601.2b, 701.4a, 702.73a, 607.2q): the additional cost beholds a Goblin, and Chomping Changeling, a changeling
# revealed from the hand, is every creature type, so it is one. It is exiled as the cost is paid. When Bot2's Swords to Plowshares
# exiles the Champion, the exiled Chomping Changeling returns to its owner's hand.

